# Quick Add from a pane zoomed into another project adds to INBOX and leaves the zoom and focus as they were.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
	- Email boss
	- Ship it
END
keys j j . j
see 󰋜 › Work
keys q
type Idea
keys <Enter>
status Added to INBOX
see 󰋜 › Work
see ▌   - Ship it
hide Idea
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
	- Idea
Work:
	- Email boss
	- Ship it
END
